This is a **sample post** so the blog pages have something to show while you work.

## How to use Keystatic

Run `npm run dev`, open `http://localhost:4321/keystatic`, and click **Blog posts**. Write, add a cover image, set the pillar, and untick **Draft** when you want it live.

- Drafts show on your computer, with a **Draft** badge.
- Drafts are hidden on the live site until you untick **Draft** and push.

> One idea per post. What I tried, and what happened.
